          <li><strong>Electronic Sensor Troubleshooting:</strong> Replacing solenoid coils, infrared motion sensors, and waterproof battery packs on hands-free automatic flush assemblies across Phoenix enterprise buildings.</li>
          <li><strong>Heavy-Duty Drain Clearing:</strong> Utilizing power cable augers to clear heavy commercial blockages caused by non-flushable wet wipes, sanitary items, and foreign objects without pulling fixtures off schedule.</li>
          <li><strong>ADA Restroom Compliance Audits:</strong> Adjusting fixture height, flush handle placement on the wide side of stalls, and grab bar clearances to meet City of Phoenix commercial building accessibility codes.</li>
        </ul>
